{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jer-1-intro","title":"Jeremiah 1 — Chapter Introduction","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":0,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":0},"content":"<p>wolf. 11:6-9; 35:9; Ac 9:1,19-21; 1Co 6:9-11; Tit 3:3-7 dust. Ge 3:14,15; Ro 16:20; Re 12:7-9; 20:2,3 shall not. 2:4; 11:9; Mic 4:3 my. 11; Eze 43:11; Zec 8:3; 14:20,21; Re 14:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-1","title":"Jeremiah 1:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The time, 4 and the calling of Jeremiah. 11 His prophetical visions of an almond rod and a seething pot. 15 His heavy message against Judah. 17 God encourages him with his promise of assistance.</p>\n<p>words. 2Ch 36:21; Isa 1:1; 2:1; Am 1:1; 7:10 of the priests. Eze 1:3 in Anathoth. 11:21; 32:7-9; Jos 21:17,18; 1Ch 6:60</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-2","title":"Jeremiah 1:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>the word. 4,11; 1Ki 13:20; Ho 1:1; Jon 1:1; Mic 1:1 in the days. 2Ki 21:25,26; 22:1-23:37; 2Ch 34:1-35:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-3","title":"Jeremiah 1:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>It came also. 25:1-3; 26:1-24; 35:1-36:32; 2Ki 24:1-9; 2Ch 36:5-8 unto the end. 21:1-22:30; 28:1-29:32; 34:1-22; 37:1-39:18; 52:1-34; 2Ki 24:17-20 2Ki 25:1-30; 2Ch 36:11-21 in the fifth. 52:12,15; 2Ki 25:8; Zec 7:5; 8:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-4","title":"Jeremiah 1:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>the word. 2; Eze 1:3; 3:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-5","title":"Jeremiah 1:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Before I. Ps 71:5,6; Isa 49:1,5; Lu 1:76; Ga 1:15,16 I knew. Ex 33:12,17; Ro 8:29; 2Ti 2:19-21 and before. Lu 1:15,41; Ro 1:1 and I ordained. Heb. and I gave. Eph 1:22; 4:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-6","title":"Jeremiah 1:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Ah, Lord. 4:10; 14:13; 32:17 I cannot. Ex 4:1,10-16; 6:12,30; Isa 6:5 for I am. 1Ki 3:7-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-7","title":"Jeremiah 1:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>for thou shalt. 17,18; Ex 7:1,2; Nu 22:20,38; 1Ki 22:14; 2Ch 18:13; Eze 2:3-5 Eze 3:17-21,27; Mt 28:20; Mr 16:15,16; Ac 20:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-8","title":"Jeremiah 1:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>not afraid. 17; Isa 51:7,12; Eze 2:6,7; 3:8,9; Mt 10:26; Lu 12:4,5; Ac 4:13,29 Eph 6:20 for I am. 15:20,21; 20:11; Ex 3:12; De 31:6,8; Jos 1:5,9; Isa 43:2; Mt 28:20 Ac 7:9,10; 18:10; 26:17; 2Co 1:8-10; 2Ti 4:17,18; Heb 13:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-9","title":"Jeremiah 1:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>and touched. Ex 4:11,12; Isa 6:6,7; 49:2; 50:4; Lu 21:15 Behold. 5:14; Ex 4:15,16; Isa 51:16; Eze 3:10; Mt 10:19; Lu 12:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-10","title":"Jeremiah 1:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>I have. 25:15-27; 27:2-7; 46:1-51:64; 1Ki 17:1; Re 11:3-6 to root out. 18:7-9; 1Ki 19:17; Eze 32:18; 43:3; Am 3:7; Zec 1:6; 2Co 10:4,5 Re 19:19-21 to build. 18:9; 24:6; 31:4,5,28; Isa 44:26-28; Eze 36:36; Am 9:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-11","title":"Jeremiah 1:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>what seest thou. Am 7:8; 8:2; Zec 4:2; 5:2 I see a rod. Nu 17:8; Eze 7:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-12","title":"Jeremiah 1:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Thou hast. De 5:28; 18:17; Lu 10:28; 20:39 I will. 39:1-18; 52:1-34; De 32:35; Eze 12:22,23,25,28; Am 8:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-13","title":"Jeremiah 1:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>the second time. Ge 41:32; 2Co 13:1,2 I see. Eze 11:3,7; 24:3-14 toward the north. Heb. from the face of the north.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-14","title":"Jeremiah 1:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Out of. 4:6; 6:1,22; 10:22; 31:8; 46:20; 50:9,41; Isa 41:25; Eze 1:4 break forth. Heb. be opened.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-15","title":"Jeremiah 1:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>I will call. 5:15; 6:22; 10:22,25; 25:9,28,31,32 and they. 39:3; 43:10; Isa 22:7 and against. 4:16; 9:11; 33:10; 34:22; 44:6; De 28:49-53; La 5:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-16","title":"Jeremiah 1:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>And I. 4:12,28; 5:9,29; Eze 24:14; Joe 2:11; Mt 23:35,36 who have. 2:13,17; 15:6; 16:11; 17:13; 19:4; De 28:20; 31:16; Jos 24:20 2Ki 22:17; 2Ch 7:19; 15:2; 34:25 and have. 7:9; 11:12,17; 44:17; Isa 65:3; Eze 8:9-11; Ho 11:2 worshipped. 10:8,9,15; 51:17; Isa 2:8; 37:19; 44:15; Ho 8:6; Ac 7:41</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-17","title":"Jeremiah 1:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>gird up. 1Ki 18:46; 2Ki 4:29; 9:1; Job 38:3; Lu 12:35; 1Pe 1:13 and speak. 7; 23:28; Ex 7:2; Eze 3:10,11; Jon 3:2; Ac 20:20,27 be not. 8; 17:18; Ex 3:12; Eze 2:6,7; 1Th 2:2 confound thee. or, break thee to pieces. Eze 3:14-18; 33:6-8; 1Co 9:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-18","title":"Jeremiah 1:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>I have. 6:27; 15:20; Isa 50:7; Eze 3:8,9; Mic 3:8,9; Joh 1:42 against. 21:4-14; 22:1-30; 26:12-15; 34:3,20-22; 36:27-32; 37:7; 38:2,18 42:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-1-19","title":"Jeremiah 1:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>And they. 11:19; 15:10-21; 20:1-6; 26:11-24; 29:25-32; 37:11-21; 38:6-13 Ps 129:2 for I am. 8; 15:20,21; Jos 1:9</p>"}]}